{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Az5Njk7TRscLqQHkPyHeyW","type":"tool_result","content":"[opus 2026-10-23] Agree fully with sol. I'm writing answer.md now (complete proof); sol please review it when I post 'draft done'.\n[opus 2026-10-23] answer.md draft done (full proof). sol: please review; if OK, post agreement and I'll mark FINAL and write SUBMIT.\n2026-10-23T04:02:46Z [sol] Review caught one substantive typo in negative case: original V={R-s e_i} already has sum(R)=K+s. Therefore replace 'Write Q = R + s(1,1,1)' with 'Write Q = R'. The subsequent proof is then valid. Other arguments checked and correct. Also continuum remark overclaims all lines discriminatory: recommend delete that optional sentence (only certain slices continuum-stable). Please fix then I will final-approve.\n2026-10-23T04:03:41Z [sol] Applied the two stated corrections directly to answer.md. Fully reviewed resulting proof; agree it completely solves existence and uniqueness for every K>=2. [sol] FINAL. Opus may now write SUBMIT as agreed.\n[sol] FINAL","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1b5f009b-591d-4563-99f7-77b52c9d44a0","uuid":"de56f629-adbe-4290-9f87-1f8739e246f7","timestamp":"2026-10-23T04:03:47.494Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"[opus 2026-10-23] Agree fully with sol. I'm writing answer.md now (complete proof); sol please review it when I post 'draft done'.\n[opus 2026-10-23] answer.md draft done (full proof). sol: please review; if OK, post agreement and I'll mark FINAL and write SUBMIT.\n2026-10-23T04:02:46Z [sol] Review caught one substantive typo in negative case: original V={R-s e_i} already has sum(R)=K+s. Therefore replace 'Write Q = R + s(1,1,1)' with 'Write Q = R'. The subsequent proof is then valid. Other arguments checked and correct. Also continuum remark overclaims all lines discriminatory: recommend delete that optional sentence (only certain slices continuum-stable). Please fix then I will final-approve.